/v1/","context":{"app_id":4865360,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4865360-1846651706692564","game_id":"steam-4865360","kind":"update","title":"Update 1.4: launching 5 November, with a profit bridge and Save Slots","summary":"Novalex Project Zero is a car-company tycoon: design cars, build production lines and compete with rival companies. It launches on 5 November, and Version 1.4.0 is the final big update before launch. The free demo is live now. If you enjoy it, wishlist the full game to hear the moment it launches. Why you made or lost money The new profit bridge on the dashboard goes step by step from revenue to net result, so you can see which cost changed your result without opening a report. The key figures a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:06:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692564","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4865360-1840310314349603","game_id":"steam-4865360","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo arrives 12 August, with controller and Steam Input support","summary":"The demo opens on 12 August This is the build it ships from. Most of the work since the last update went into two things: making the game behave on hardware it had never been properly tested on, and correcting parts of the simulation that were quietly wrong. Controller and Steam Input support You can play the whole game on a pad. Steam Input actions drive the same navigation the keyboard uses, and touching the keyboard or mouse suspends pad focus so the two stop fighting over where you are. A mi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T17:28:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314349603","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4865360-1839041357033806","game_id":"steam-4865360","kind":"announcement","title":"A Complete Visual Redesign, a Guided Tutorial, and Steam Deck Support","summary":"Update 1.2 This is the biggest update Novalex Project Zero has had. Nearly every screen has been rebuilt, there is a proper tutorial for new players, and the game now behaves itself on a Steam Deck and on very wide monitors. What's new A complete visual redesign. The garage, car designer, reports and research used to live inside stacked pop-up dialogs. Each is now a full-page view behind a persistent sidebar rail, with a KPI strip along the top and a new icon set throughout. A guided tutorial fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T13:45:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357033806","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4865360-1836506165574119","game_id":"steam-4865360","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Update - First Trailer, Native Localization, and Now on Linux & macOS","summary":"Playtest Update First of all, thank you. The bug reports you have been sending in have been incredibly helpful, and this update is built directly on them. We read every one, and they made the game better - so please keep them coming. Here is what changed since the last playtest build. What's new Now on Linux and macOS. The playtest now ships native builds for Linux and macOS, alongside Windows. Install it on your platform of choice straight from Steam. Our first trailer. Novalex Project Zero fin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-05T15:21:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165574119","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4865360-1836506165556028","game_id":"steam-4865360","kind":"announcement","title":"The Novalex Project Zero Playtest Is Now Open","summary":"The Novalex Project Zero Playtest Is Now Open Build your own car company from a single garage into a global manufacturer. Design cars, research new tech, set up production lines, price your lineup, and outmaneuver around 30 AI rivals in a turn based market that reacts to every move you make. The playtest is open to everyone right now, and we would love your help shaping the game before launch. How to join the playtest It only takes a moment, and access is granted automatically: Head to the Noval","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-27T08:20:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165556028","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4865360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4865360":"2026-10-26T04:48:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4865360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4904010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4865360","app_id":4865360,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:03Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"st